(34, 1, '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '<!-- wp:html-->\n<main class=\"wrapper\">\n  <article class=\"legal_page_card\">\n    \n    <header class=\"legal_header\">\n      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n      <p class=\"legal_meta\">Effective Date: October 27, 2026 | Last Updated: October 27, 2026</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"legal_content_body\">\n      <p>\n        Welcome to <strong>Upskills Team Building Services</strong> (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"). We are committed to protecting your personal data and respecting your privacy in compliance with Republic Act No. 10173, otherwise known as the <strong>Data Privacy Act of 2012 (DPA)</strong> of the Philippines, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR).\n      </p>\n      \n      <p>\n        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal information when you visit our main website (<a href=\"https://upskillscebu.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">upskillscebu.com</a>) or use our digital services and booking system (<a href=\"https://app.upskillscebu.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">app.upskillscebu.com</a>).\n      </p>\n\n      <hr class=\"legal_divider\" />\n\n      <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>\n      <p>We collect information directly from you when you submit booking inquiries, request proposals, or coordinate team events:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Full name, company email address, contact phone number, and physical office location.</li>\n        <li><strong>Corporate &amp; Event Information:</strong> Company name, department, estimated participant count, target event date, team goals, and selected package tier.</li>\n        <li><strong>Participant Safety Information:</strong> Attendee names, emergency contact details, and dietary or medical restrictions required to ensure participant health and safety during physical workshops and outdoor activities.</li>\n        <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and interaction logs captured via standard web logs and analytics.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>2. Legal Basis and Purpose of Processing</h3>\n      <p>We process your personal information strictly for legitimate business and operational purposes:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> Crafting custom itineraries, preparing formal quotations, and delivering facilitated workshops.</li>\n        <li><strong>Coordination &amp; Communication:</strong> Confirming reservations, answering inquiries, and relaying venue preparations.</li>\n        <li><strong>Safety Management:</strong> Adapting physical exercises and dietary plans to participant medical considerations.</li>\n        <li><strong>Platform Improvement:</strong> Monitoring platform performance, securing user sessions, and enhancing our service delivery.</li>\n        <li><strong>Statutory Compliance:</strong> Fulfilling accounting, tax, and lawful regulatory requirements in the Philippines.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>3. Disclosure and Sharing of Data</h3>\n      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We only share necessary event information under strict confidentiality with:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Internal Staff &amp; Facilitators:</strong> Certified trainers and event coordinators directly managing your event.</li>\n        <li><strong>Logistics &amp; Venue Partners:</strong> Partner resorts, adventure venues, transport operators, and caterers strictly on a need-to-know basis.</li>\n        <li><strong>Technical Service Providers:</strong> Cloud database and authentication providers (such as Supabase) and web hosting environments (such as Hostinger) operating under robust security standards.</li>\n        <li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> When required by Philippine law, subpoena, or to protect the safety and rights of participants and facilitators.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>4. Storage and Data Security</h3>\n      <p>We apply organizational, physical, and technical security controls to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, or accidental destruction of your data:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li>All communications between your device and our servers are encrypted using <strong>SSL/TLS</strong>.</li>\n        <li>Database access is partitioned via strict <strong>Row Level Security (RLS)</strong> policies.</li>\n        <li>Information is retained only as long as necessary to complete your contracted team building services and satisfy legal or tax record-keeping requirements.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>5. Photography and Media Coverage</h3>\n      <p>\n        During workshops and outdoor sessions, photos and video recordings may be taken for program recaps, participant debriefings, and promotional portfolios. Client organizations or individual participants may opt out of promotional publication by notifying our lead facilitator prior to the event.\n      </p>\n\n      <h3>6. Your Rights Under Philippine Law</h3>\n      <p>Under the Data Privacy Act of 2012, you are entitled to the following rights as a data subject:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Right to be Informed:</strong> To understand how and why your personal information is collected and processed.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> To request copies of your personal information held in our records.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> To dispute inaccuracies or errors in your data and request prompt corrections.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Erasure or Blocking:</strong> To request the suspension, withdrawal, or deletion of your personal records from our systems.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Damages:</strong> To receive indemnification for damages sustained due to inaccurate, incomplete, or unlawful processing.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>7. Contact Our Data Protection Officer (DPO)</h3>\n      <p>For any inquiries, requests to exercise your data subject rights, or privacy concerns, please reach us through our verified channels:</p>\n      <ol class=\"contact_list\">\n        <li><strong>Service Provider:</strong> Upskills Team Building Services</li>\n        <li><strong>Location:</strong> Cebu City, Cebu, Philippines</li>\n        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:hello.upskills@gmail.com\" class=\"legal_link\">hello.upskills@gmail.com</a></li>\n        <li><strong>Phone / Mobile:</strong> <a href=\"tel:+639610115585\" class=\"legal_link\">0961-011-5585</a></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n  </article>\n</main>   \n<!-- /wp:post-content -->', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'privacy-policy', '', '', '2026-10-29 05:51:58', '2026-10-29 05:51:58', '', 0, 'https://localhost/ustbs26/?page_id=34', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(35, 1, '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '<main class=\"legal_page_container wrapper\">\n  <article class=\"legal_page_card\">\n    \n    <header class=\"legal_header\">\n      <span class=\"legal_badge\">Legal & Transparency</span>\n      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n      <p class=\"legal_meta\">Effective Date: October 27, 2026 | Last Updated: October 27, 2026</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"legal_content_body\">\n      <p>\n        Welcome to <strong>Upskills Team Building Services</strong> (\"we,\" \"our,\" or \"us\"). We are committed to protecting your personal data and respecting your privacy in compliance with Republic Act No. 10173, otherwise known as the <strong>Data Privacy Act of 2012 (DPA)</strong> of the Philippines, and its Implementing Rules and Regulations (IRR).\n      </p>\n      \n      <p>\n        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal information when you visit our main website (<a href=\"https://upskillscebu.com\">upskillscebu.com</a>) or use our digital services and booking system (<a href=\"https://app.upskillscebu.com\">app.upskillscebu.com</a>).\n      </p>\n\n      <hr />\n\n      <h3>1. Information We Collect</h3>\n      <p>We collect information directly from you when you submit booking inquiries, request proposals, or coordinate team events:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Full name, company email address, contact number, and office address.</li>\n        <li><strong>Corporate & Event Information:</strong> Company name, department, estimated participant count, target event date, team goals, and selected package tier.</li>\n        <li><strong>Participant Safety Information:</strong> Attendee names, emergency contact details, and dietary or medical restrictions required to ensure participant health and safety during physical workshops and outdoor activities.</li>\n        <li><strong>Technical Data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device information, and interaction logs captured via standard web logs and analytics.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>2. Legal Basis and Purpose of Processing</h3>\n      <p>We process your personal information strictly for legitimate business and operational purposes:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> Crafting custom itineraries, preparing formal quotations, and delivering facilitated workshops.</li>\n        <li><strong>Coordination & Communication:</strong> Confirming reservations, answering inquiries, and relaying venue preparations.</li>\n        <li><strong>Safety Management:</strong> Adapting physical exercises and dietary plans to participant medical considerations.</li>\n        <li><strong>Platform Improvement:</strong> Monitoring platform performance, securing user sessions, and enhancing our service delivery.</li>\n        <li><strong>Statutory Compliance:</strong> Fulfilling accounting, tax, and lawful regulatory requirements in the Philippines.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>3. Disclosure and Sharing of Data</h3>\n      <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. We only share necessary event information under strict confidentiality with:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Internal Staff & Facilitators:</strong> Certified trainers and event coordinators directly managing your event.</li>\n        <li><strong>Logistics & Venue Partners:</strong> Partner resorts, adventure venues, transport operators, and caterers strictly on a need-to-know basis.</li>\n        <li><strong>Technical Service Providers:</strong> Cloud database and authentication providers (such as Supabase) and web hosting environments (such as Hostinger) operating under robust security standards.</li>\n        <li><strong>Legal Authorities:</strong> When required by Philippine law, subpoena, or to protect the safety and rights of participants and facilitators.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>4. Storage and Data Security</h3>\n      <p>We apply organizational, physical, and technical security controls to prevent unauthorized access, disclosure, or accidental destruction of your data:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li>All communications between your device and our servers are encrypted using <strong>SSL/TLS</strong>.</li>\n        <li>Database access is partitioned via strict <strong>Row Level Security (RLS)</strong> policies.</li>\n        <li>Information is retained only as long as necessary to complete your contracted team building services and satisfy legal or tax record-keeping requirements.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>5. Photography and Media Coverage</h3>\n      <p>\n        During workshops and outdoor sessions, photos and video recordings may be taken for program recaps, participant debriefings, and promotional portfolios. Client organizations or individual participants may opt out of promotional publication by notifying our lead facilitator prior to the event.\n      </p>\n\n      <h3>6. Your Rights Under Philippine Law</h3>\n      <p>Under the Data Privacy Act of 2012, you are entitled to the following rights as a data subject:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Right to be Informed:</strong> To understand how and why your personal information is collected and processed.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Access:</strong> To request copies of your personal information held in our records.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Rectification:</strong> To dispute inaccuracies or errors in your data and request prompt corrections.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Erasure or Blocking:</strong> To request the suspension, withdrawal, or deletion of your personal records from our systems.</li>\n        <li><strong>Right to Damages:</strong> To receive indemnification for damages sustained due to inaccurate, incomplete, or unlawful processing.</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3>7. Contact Our Data Protection Officer (DPO)</h3>\n      <p>For any inquiries, requests to exercise your data subject rights, or privacy concerns, please contact us:</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>Service Provider:</strong> Upskills Team Building Services</li>\n        <li><strong>Address:</strong> Cebu City, Cebu, Philippines</li>\n        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:hello.upskills@gmail.com\">hello.upskills@gmail.com</a></li>\n        <li><strong>Phone / Mobile:</strong> 0961-011-5585</li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n  </article>\n</main>', 'Privacy Policy', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '34-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '2026-10-27 06:00:30', '', 34, 'https://localhost/ustbs26/?p=35', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
